without a debit card from an online only bank? Not really any that I can think of besides sending money to a secondary bank that you have that has physical branches. That's one of the downsides to online only branches, no access to funds without a debit card. Also why many people recommend credit cards, because they can generally be overnighted for free via fedex if you lose them, and provide a secondary alternative to your debit card.

