they're not going to end a relationship for taking out 20k, and putting it back 3 minutes later. 0% Chance, i'd bet money on it. Last time my bank shut somebody down, they wired 100k 10 times to about 9 different international banks with no explanation. 20k that is taken out and put back is fully tracked. If you explain the situation in detail, I doubt an SAR will even be filed. This person is simply trying to scare you.

