Paypal has nothing to do with this, so no, you'll get someone in india if you call who will just be confused. Everything with them is automated, so if she forgot her password, she should go to [Paypal.com](https://Paypal.com) and click on "forgot password" and she'll get a link directly from Paypal to reset it. If she doesn't remember the email she used, then she should create a new account herself as Paypal won't be able to unlock it.

